Inlined the field lookup and value extraction, bypassing the out-of-line generic `GetFieldUINT32Value` wrapper and its subfield-resolution path (which is a no-op for this field). This eliminates one function call and redundant subfield checks per invocation.

```cpp
    FIT_UINT32 GetSurfaceInterval(void) const
    {
        const Field* field = GetField(4);
        if (field == NULL)
            return 0;
        return field->GetValueUINT32();
    }
```